{"step_index":132,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:39:40Z","thinking":"**Building the MAD Unlock**\n\nI'm currently focused on the \"Interactive Explorer Passport Widget.\" I envision a floating luxury Passport badge, that shows a user's progress: `[ 🎒 Explorer Passport: 0/12 Unlocked • Rank: Novice Explorer ]`. It will be a key part of the \"MAD Unlock Experience\".\n\n\n**Designing the Modal Passport**\n\nI've been iterating on the Explorer Passport Modal. It now features a progress bar for level and rank, 12 stamp slots (some unlocked with details and others locked with hints), a \"Generate Official Digital Certificate\" button, and a demo \"Quick Unlock All\" button for testing. The modal itself is envisioned as a digital leather and gold experience.\n\n\n**Implementing Unlock Mechanics**\n\nI've been refining the unlock mechanics. Now, hovering over a card, opening its modal, or clicking map elements all trigger unlocks. I'm also planning the \"MAD Unlock\" animation: a golden banner, a canvas sparkle burst, and a glowing seal badge on the card. LocalStorage will track the user's progress.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/* ==========================================================================\\n   JHARKHAND TOURISM - PREMIUM EDITORIAL DESIGN SYSTEM\\n   Visual Identity: Deep Forest Green, Warm Sand, Muted Gold, Charcoal\\n   Features: 100% Authentic Photos & Gamified Tourist Passport Unlock System\\n   ========================================================================== */\\n\\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n   CSS VARIABLES & DESIGN TOKENS\\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\\n:root {\\n  /* Color Palette - Refined Natural & Luxury */\\n  --bg-prime: #061A13;            /* Deep Forest Night */\\n  --bg-surface: #0B241B;          /* Deep Emerald Surface */\\n  --bg-