{"step_index":134,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-22T11:40:13Z","thinking":"**Developing Interactive Logic**\n\nOkay, I'm working on the `js/app.js` update. I'm focusing on the Interactive Unlock Engine. Right now, I'm setting up an `unlockedDestinations` array that will be stored in `localStorage` under the name `jharkhand_unlocked_places`. There is also an `unlockDestination(id)` function. I've designed it to first check if a destination is already unlocked. If it isn't, I want it to add the ID.\n\n\n**Implementing Unlock Actions**\n\nOkay, I've got the `unlockDestination()` function handling a bunch of crucial updates now. It's designed to award XP and update the Explorer Rank, complete with a dynamic progress bar. I'm also adding particle confetti on the canvas and triggering a custom toast notification. The cards are getting the checkmark stamp, the passport badge is updating, and the passport stamps modal re-renders. I'm also implementing the autounlock triggers now.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/**\\n * Jharkhand Tourism - Official Application Logic\\n * Elevated UI/UX Controller, Gamified Tourist Passport Unlock System & 3D Card Tilt\\n * Focus: FAMOUS DESTINATIONS & INTERACTIVE EXPLORER EXPEDITION\\n */\\n\\n// Global State for Explorer Passport\\nlet unlockedDestinations = [];\\nlet totalScoreXP = 0;\\n\\ndocument.addEventListener(\\\"DOMContentLoaded\\\", () => {\\n  // 1. Load unlocked state from localStorage\\n  loadPassportProgress();\\n\\n  // 2. Initialize Loading Screen\\n  initPreloader();\\n\\n  // 3. Initialize Navigation & Reading Progress\\n  initNavigation();\\n  initScrollProgressBar();\\n\\n  // 4. Render Famous Destinations\\n  renderFamousDestinations();\\n  renderDidYouKnowFacts();\\n  renderTravelThemes();\\n\\n  // 5. Initialize Category Filters\\n  initCategoryFilters();\\n\\n  // 6. Initialize Desktop Custom Cursor & 3D Card Tilt\\n  initCardCursorFollower();\\n  initCard3DTilt();\\n\\n  // 7. Initialize Scroll Reveal Animations & Stat Counters\\n  initScrollReveals();\\n  initStatCounters();\\n\\n  // 8. Initialize Leaflet Map\\n  if (typeof initJharkhandMap === \\\"function\\\") {\\n    initJharkhandMap();\\n  }\\n\\n  // 9. Initialize Confetti Canvas\\n  initConfettiCanvas();\\n\\n  // 10. Update UI Passport Badges\\n  updatePassportUI();\\n});\\n\\n/* ==========================================================================\\n   1. PRELOADER CONTROLLER\\n   ========================================================================== */\\nfunction initPreloader() {\\n  const preloader = document.getElementById(\\\"preloader\\\");\\n  if (!preloader) return;\\n\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"load\\\", () => {\\n    setTimeout(() => {\\n      preloader.classList.add(\\\"hidden\\\");\\n    }, 900);\\n  });\\n\\n  setTimeout(() => {\\n    if (!preloader.classList.contains(\\\"hidden\\\")) {\\n      preloader.classList.add(\\\"hidden\\\");\\n    }\\n  }, 2500);\\n}\\n\\n/* ==========================================================================\\n   2. READING SCROLL PROGRESS BAR\\n   ========================================================================== */\\nfunction ini\n<truncated 31539 bytes>","Description":"\"Update app.js with Explorer Passport unlock engine, confetti VFX, and remove nature sound code\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Bhavish Sawant\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\jharkhand-tourism\\\\js\\\\app.js\"","toolAction":"\"Updating app.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating app.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
